			"Message": "feat(Sky): Add OTEL + PostHog telemetry bridges and streamline workbench loading\n\nImplement build-baked telemetry for debug builds:\n- Add OTELBridge.ts: PerformanceObserver capturing all `land:*` marks → OTLP/HTTP\n- Add PostHogBridge.ts: Error tracking and analytics via CDN (tree-shaken in prod)\n- Add TelemetryBridge.astro: Shared component loading both bridges for all workbenches\n\nRefactor workbench loading to use performance.mark() instead of console.log:\n- Browser.astro, BrowserTest.astro, Electron/Layout.astro, Mountain.astro\n- Consistent `land:{workbench}:{stage}:{start|done|error}` naming\n- Enables OTELBridge to capture complete boot sequence timing\n\nUpdate Wind preload import paths:\n- `@codeeditorland/wind/Target/Function/Install` → `@codeeditorland/wind/Target/Function/Install/Function/Install`\n\nEnhance astro.config.ts build:\n- Step 13: Copy built-in VS Code extensions from .build/extensions/\n- PostHog build telemetry: sends step timings to analytics on build complete\n- Vite proxy: OTLP /v1/traces → localhost:4318 for Jaeger/OTEL collector\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Wind preload import path changed; ensure Wind is rebuilt.",
